omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nYxYJZLDzhUQ7kNvwEe-JVJ&_nc_oc=AdoDA0xZ8nDRhJ9EnS2BM-AoqOnJJ4J7w8SKzVZ4UIpl2cWgxvbbJiZ0FLNnVNLlmwY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHz0IjbUPtDpeNHVKZGdlAeOEEL1MGmVfx37KZQmvOzRg&oe=6A7203B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E-MpLtgYOHgQ7kNvwFiagDw&_nc_oc=AdoetN-d0dlxQ5Rn2bgTPsw96BI5JyBfiClGWxhc-Y7e4iLNozTWxyC8UGJu2BQmP3o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF0rF9iiIwPtbr7zp39jE89tryw4_UJ0LwyVbK_F_-VWA&oe=6A71CCD6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k4Km1-5ACAMQ7kNvwFZVswg&_nc_oc=AdpgaRA9So98D5TaepRhAU9a3G0qoQBynQHl45OmewJe4Zpnr1zq3MyW_AfINCcvyMU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG6Eofa0X09dN7ca2OA4gybFdZgI-VbBiMEEr2yMzv3pg&oe=6A71E1F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://